# TDD Skill Routing

Before implementing or correcting production behavior, read and apply
`.agents/skills/tdd/SKILL.md`. Also load it for behavior-preserving refactoring
or when reviewing claimed TDD evidence, so its scope and exceptions are respected.

The skill is the single source of truth for the TDD method. Do not duplicate
or replace its instructions in this rule. If it is missing or unreadable,
report that limitation instead of claiming that it was applied.

Follow the repository's separate execution, security and delivery constraints.
